<p id="Thmtheorem20.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem20.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">where <math id="Thmtheorem20.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{uv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math> is the unique path connecting <math id="Thmtheorem20.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmtheorem20.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">v</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmtheorem20.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N[p_{uv}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">v</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N[p_{uv}]</annotation></semantics></math> is the set of neighbors of points in <math id="Thmtheorem20.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{uv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">p</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{uv}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
