_{\Lambda},+,-}Z_{T_{0},u,v_{0}}^{\sigma_{\Lambda},-,+})\prod\limits_{i=1}^{l}(\beta Z_{T_{i},v_{i}}^{\sigma_{\Lambda},+}+Z_{T_{i},v_{i}}^{\sigma_{\Lambda},-})(Z_{T_{i},v_{i}}^{\sigma_{\Lambda},+}+\gamma Z_{T_{i},v_{i}}^{\sigma_{\Lambda},-}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
