<div id="S4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Also, by Lemma </span><a href="#Thmtheorem24" title="Lemma 24. ‣ 3.4 Zero-freeness implies a uniform bound on a circle ‣ 3 Zero-freeness implies SSM for 𝜆 ‣ From Zero-Freeness to Strong Spatial Mixing viaa Christoffel-Darboux Type Identity" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a><span id="S4.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, for any circle around </span><math id="S4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/\gamma</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, we can get a uniform bound for </span><math id="S4.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}_{G,v}(\beta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">P</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">G</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">v</mi></mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">β</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P^{\sigma_{\Lambda}}_{G,v}(\beta)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> on it.</span></p>
